# The README hero. Rerun from the repository root: vhs docs/ai-check.tape
Output docs/ai-check.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 17
Set Width 1440
Set Height 180
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Show
Sleep 600ms
Type "deno task ai --check"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 4s
